His office would eventually be situated near Smalls Paradise, a famous nightclub. Victor didn't have the most obvious background for starting a travel guide. He didn't work in tourism, he wasn't a writer, he was a mailman in Hackensack, New Jersey. But he kept hearing stories about discrimination on the road. So he would go do his route in Hackensack, New Jersey, come back home and work on a green book at night, compiling these addresses, typing them up and putting them in a book form. This is Calvin Alexander Ramsey, playwright, author, and filmmaker.
他的办公室后来设在著名的夜总会“小天堂”（Smalls Paradise）附近。维克多并没有创办旅行指南的明显背景。他不从事旅游业，也不是作家，他只是新泽西州哈肯萨克的一名邮递员。但他不断听到关于路上歧视的故事。所以他会在哈肯萨克完成他的投递路线，回到家后晚上编写《绿皮书》，汇编这些地址，打字并整理成书。这是卡尔文·亚历山大·拉姆齐（Calvin Alexander Ramsey），剧作家、作家和电影制作人。

